Section: 5. Conclusion
Text: We used the same guide- lines used in the annotation of the English OLID dataset (Zampieri et al., 2019a). Finally, we run several machine learning and deep learning classiﬁers and the best results were achieved by a LSTM and GRU with Attention model.

