Text: RELATED WORK Most large comprehension data sets are open-domain be- cause non-experts can be readily recruited via crowdsourcing platforms to collect annotations. Development of domain- speciﬁc RC data sets, on the other hand, is costly due to the need of subject matter experts and as such the size of these data sets is typically limited.

